WEBVTT

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.640
Sasaki-senpai, good morning.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.430
Morning, Mya-chan.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.350
You're here early today.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.110
Yeah. I got a summons from Hirano.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.770
A "summons?"

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.070
You know how exams are coming up?

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:36.570
See, my grades aren't so good,
so Hirano is helping me study.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:40.410
Since he has a curfew as a
dorm student, it has to be early.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.910
I see.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:49.750
Mya-chan, are you free for a bit?

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.170
Hirano says he'll be late.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.470
Join me for some cocoa.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:57.220
I still haven't shared my thoughts
about the last manga I borrowed.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:18.490
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.390
"Cocoa"

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.650
"Episode 3: 'Senpai Is...'"

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.650
Are you okay?

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.980
"Episode 3: 'Senpai Is...'"

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.980
Yeah.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.400
"Episode 3: 'Senpai Is...'"

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.400
Senpai, are you cat-tongued?

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:42.530
You mean like I'm one of those people
who has trouble consuming hot stuff?

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:45.040
Mya-chan, you're grinning.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.580
D-Don't look at me!

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.580
Why do you ask?

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:56.000
U-Um, well, on TV they said cat-tongued
people are clumsy with their tongues.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.630
Oh?

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:03.090
That made me think that maybe
that means they're clumsy kissers.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:04.220
Wha...?

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:10.060
I'd been thinking that in BL,
they'd be taught how to kiss.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:15.190
So the cat-tongued <i>moe </i>made me want
to ask what it's like to be cat-tongued.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:21.400
Huh... I still don't understand
the thought process of a... <i>fudanshi</i>?

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:26.530
Hmm, in that case,
Mya-chan, ya wanna find out?

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:28.080
Find out what?

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.250
Whether I'm clumsy.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:31.710
"Beh"

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.590
I didn't mean it like that!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:39.510
I'm not looking for a BL experience!

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:42.930
Oh, Senpai, about the next manga.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.470
Mya-chan, how many manga do you have?

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.560
I d-don't have all <i>that </i>many.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.560
I feel like I've borrowed a whole lot.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.810
It's not like I'm lending you
one every day.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.650
Well, that's true.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.020
Um, here.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:04:00.820
It's part of a series.
There are more than ten.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.860
But since tastes differ, I wanted you
to read just the first few for now.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.280
Okay...

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.910
For real, how many does he have?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:11.580
I feel like I've borrowed at least 30.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.580
Thanks for the cocoa.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.630
Well, I better get going now.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.290
Oh, okay.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.220
I'm not looking for a BL experience!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.560
I'm dying to touch him...

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.070
I didn't mean it like that.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.480
I really didn't.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:45.860
But if you look at it
from an outside perspective...

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:52.330
Do you think being clumsy with your tongue
means you're also a clumsy kisser?

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.660
Ya wanna find out?

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.210
I-I didn't mean it like that...

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:02.170
It's unquestionably BL...
a hinting invitation!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.380
What now?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.890
Miyano, about this worksheet...

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.800
What's wrong?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.760
I don't know what kind of face
to make in this situation.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.310
Well you're making a despair face...

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:15.350
Never mind. I'll solve it myself.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.020
Goodness.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.070
You're so cute, Mya-chan.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.570
Wanna go out?

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:27.200
What? No.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:32.870
I've wondered ever since.
Is he joking? Or is he serious?

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.460
For a joke it seems a little too...

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.500
If there's someone I like,
I want to know them.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.010
What did Senpai mean
when he said those things?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.430
--Oh.
--What is it?

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:53.220
I forgot to give Sasaki
one of the volumes.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.560
You two are still doing the manga thing?

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.520
Yeah.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:59.520
You could probably still
catch him in his classroom.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.270
Do you mind if I go give it to him?

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:04.030
Not at all. I'll be
waiting by the entrance.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.110
Okay.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:13.160
Well, this is the second one, and with
exams he might not have time for it,

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:15.750
so it could totally wait.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.120
But I really...

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:19.830
I really want him to read them together.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:23.710
This series gets exceptionally
good with volume 2!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:28.840
Oh, good. He's still here.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:32.600
--Senpa--
--Dude, you're reading BL?

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.680
What?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.270
You into that or something?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.640
What do I do?

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.400
Once you give it a try, you see
there're some pretty good ones.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.400
What do I do?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.440
Ain't it weird that it's two guys in love?

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.780
--People are getting the wrong idea
--It could just be a guy and a girl.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:47.740
because of me!

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.700
I don't really know about that, but...

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.780
I think BL is what made
this story possible.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.790
It's good the way it is.
I don't see a problem.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.880
I just don't see what's good about BL.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.510
How come ya got such
strong feelings about BL?

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.970
It's my girlfriend. She's a <i>fujoshi</i>!

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.800
Listen to this, Sasaki.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.430
I found BL under her pillow!

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.430
Yeah. Okay.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:30.860
What're you running for? Was Senpai there?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.530
He was.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:37.290
But... I decided to give it
to him next week.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:41.160
Or I guess I should say, um...

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:47.050
S-Sasaki-senpai was so cool that, um...

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:51.590
Ow.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:56.430
Yeah, Sasaki-senpai is cool.
Now put on your shoes.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.770
Th-That's right. He's cool!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:05.060
I think Sasaki-senpai is cool.

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:08.900
I have since that moment.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:17.080
The future plans form is due Monday.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:22.000
Miyano, do you need to buy lunch?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.290
I bought mine this morning.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.790
All right. I'll be back, then.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.000
Okay.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.970
I'm cold.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.720
What do I do?

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:38.100
I still haven't given him the next volume.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.390
I don't see a problem.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:46.980
Senpai seemed fine, but what if a
classmate makes comments to him again?

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:51.110
See, I'd never read
that kind of manga before.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:55.110
So yeah, it did catch me off guard,
but it was good!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.990
But...

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:57.910
Is Miyano here?

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:01.490
Uh, yes. He's the one
curled up over there.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:03.000
Senpai.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.540
Taking a nap, Mya-chan?

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.000
No, I was just kinda cold.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.420
Oh, so that's why you were curled up?

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.550
Oh, right. Here. Thanks.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.880
It was good.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.680
Oh, thanks.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:23.640
The <i>seme </i>was the opposite of what
I first expected. That surprised me.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.100
And...

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.690
Mya-chan?

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.570
Let's find out.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:38.990
What's wr--

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.500
Um...

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.040
I can't speak...

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:49.290
I'll put this away.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.920
Right. Yeah.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:10:01.680
Hey, Mya-chan, let's leave together today.
And drop by the bookstore.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.220
Why?

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:07.730
Doesn't the new issue of
something come out tomorrow?

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.730
They might have it already.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.020
He's got me marked.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.070
Or do you have stuff you need to do?

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:18.700
No, I... don't have anything.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.950
Then, it's a plan?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.830
Yes.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.330
Oh, hey, what about
the rest of that manga?

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:28.620
Huh?

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.500
Is there only one volume?

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:35.380
Didn't you say something
about reading the first few?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.170
Well...

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:40.430
Um, here.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:41.640
Thanks.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:45.020
I'll let you know when I've read it.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:46.020
See ya later.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.230
Bye.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:58.030
I lent him another one...

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.490
I wanted you to read
just the first few for now.

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:07.540
I'm back, Miyano.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:10.080
Hellooo. Wake up, little roly poly.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:15.050
Call me that again and I'll tell your
girlfriend your potential BL bromances.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:17.090
No. She'd love that too much.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.010
I'm hot.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:32.770
"Monday, March 14th"
"Don't forget about White Day chocolates!"

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.980
A month can fly by so fast.

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:38.610
Morning, Miyano.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.030
Morning.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.570
Wait, what's all <i>that</i>?

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.370
White Day gifts for my girlfriend.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.120
I'll see her after school.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.160
Oh, it's for your girlfriend.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.000
Not for our class.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.120
The class exchanged
chocolates on Valentine's day.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.340
Only people who forgot the first time
would bring stuff today.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.380
Of course. Yeah.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:01.760
Did you bring stuff?

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.890
N-No, of course not!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.470
I didn't bring anything.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.600
For the class, anyway.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.980
"2 Days Earlier"

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.110
"2 Days Earlier"

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.110
I've almost gotten through it all.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.440
I made the most progress
while studying for exams.

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.240
"5-Yen chocolate"
"How big the 320 Yen feels"

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.320
"5-Yen chocolate"
"How big the 320 Yen feels"

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.320
But Senpai's chocolates
are weighing on me...

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:29.870
Do I not need to give something in return?

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:32.250
It <i>was </i>an exchange...

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.960
The class isn't doing return gifts...

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:39.050
You could say I've
already repaid the gift,

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:41.720
so I probably don't
need to worry about it...

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:43.380
"I-It's White Day,
so I'd like you to have this."
But...

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.470
"I-It's White Day,
so I'd like you to have this."

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:50.600
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
I can't look to BL for the answer!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:56.770
See ya. I'm heading out.

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:58.820
Okay. Bye-bye.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.900
I guess I'll just head home.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.120
Fine!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.170
Hirano-senpai.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:16.000
Miyano.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:19.630
Um, is Sasaki-senpai still here?

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.920
Yeah. I'll get him for you. One sec.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.760
Thank you.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.140
Sasaki.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.470
Yeah?

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:35.980
Oh? Mya-chan, what's up?

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.400
U-Um...

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.320
Not so loud, or the
teachers will complain.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:48.910
We're having a snack party since
exams are over. Let's find a quiet spot.

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.990
A snack party...

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:54.330
So? What brings you by, Mya-chan?

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:57.580
I haven't finished that manga yet.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:01.840
Oh, that's fine. It's something else.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.250
Um...

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:14.930
Th-This is for White Day.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:19.730
Huh?

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:23.150
Um, you're the only one outside
my class who gave me chocolates.

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.320
And it's also as thanks in general.

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.740
And although we did an exchange, um,

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:32.450
girls sometimes give gifts
on White Day, too.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.330
So I, uh...

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.330
Senpai?

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.420
Thanks.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.300
Who else did you...

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:52.050
Oh, nobody else.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.850
Oh, okay.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:57.930
Um, hold on. I'll give you something, too.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.150
Huh? Um...

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:03.110
Wait there. I'll be right back.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:03.980
I win.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:05.820
Damn, dude!

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.830
Hey. What's going on?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.250
What do I do? My heart won't stop.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.710
Good. You'd be dead if it did.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.720
It's pounding.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.590
You out of shape or something?

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:32.970
No...

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.260
"Later"

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.270
Pick a snack.

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:41.270
We got all kinds of stuff.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.400
Then... I'll take this...

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:45.190
This concludes the closing ceremony.

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:47.940
"Friday, March 18th"

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:47.940
This concludes the closing ceremony.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.450
"Friday, March 18th"

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.450
Let's all go to Disneyland
during the break!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.110
I'm already going with my girlfriend.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:57.450
Is your girlfriend the only one in
your world? You could go another day.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.500
Mya-chan.

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:02.670
Did you spot someone?

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.130
Uh, yeah.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.670
Sasaki-senpai?

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.340
Uh-huh.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.550
Keep moving.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.010
Senpai will be graduating next year.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.100
That's right...

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:23.230
Sasaki-senpai will graduate before me.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.860
Just... one more year...

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.070
Miyano.

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:37.780
Hir--it's black!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.870
I don't like where this is going.
Not another word.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.960
Hello, Hirano-senpai.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:43.790
Hey.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:47.670
Hirano-senpai, what's going on?

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:49.500
Oh, that was Hirano-senpai?!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.050
What was?

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:55.970
You have to dye it back for the
closing ceremony. Pictures and all.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:58.470
Sakaki is getting lectured as we speak.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:02.430
It'll be blond again next time you see me.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:07.900
Bl-Black looks n-nice, too!
It's fresh. Black-haired <i>uke</i>.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.980
Hey, quit taking pictures.

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:13.280
Senpai, do you bleach your hair?

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:17.030
--I've bleached it several times,
so it's pretty damaged.
--Please stop.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:18.950
Wanna feel it?

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.370
Senpai, your hair is very fine.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.000
Is it?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:26.330
Did you let your roommate touch it?

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:29.670
Yeah. He's the one who
told me it's damaged.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.050
Thank you very much.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.590
Huh?

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:35.380
Hey, Hirano. Sorry you had to wai--

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:37.720
Oh, what are you guys up to?

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:41.850
Discussing hair damage.
Yours isn't very damaged, right?

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:45.100
Have you ever left your hair black?

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:47.900
Yeah, when I was a freshman.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:51.320
Senpai with black hair...

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.860
Want me to dye it?

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:57.240
If it matters that little to you,
get it dyed for today!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.990
What're you guys doin'?

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:02.040
Ogasawara, took you long enough.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:05.660
Sorry. But you know,
I only have highlights.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.380
--This is my classmate Ogasawara.
--I get why they fussed over Sakaki.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:12.550
Ogasawara, this is Mya--
Miyano and Kuresawa.

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.960
"Miyano"?

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.510
Oh! The <i>fudanshi</i>!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.970
Senpai, how does he know that?

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.600
He saw me putting the manga in my bag.

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:21.930
Senpai!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:28.690
Not just girls, but guys liking BL.
The hell is going on?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:32.860
Could this be the guy I saw?

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:37.740
Ain't it weird that it's two guys in love?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.240
Is something wrong?

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.660
Now, now, don't get heated...

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.330
I'm not heated!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:46.710
...just because your girlfriend
likes delinquent <i>ukes</i>.

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.540
Oh, he's fine now.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.080
The BL manga she was hiding
had a delinquent

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.670
being topped by a big buff dude.

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.050
What is she reading?

00:18:55.050 --> 00:19:00.050
A <i>fujoshi </i>gets all smiley
seeing dudes together, right?

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:07.270
I really like her, but she... she...

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:11.310
Has she wanted me to get with
a dude this whole time?!

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:15.980
We're having a get-together to
make him feel better. Wanna come?

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.860
Pass. I have plans with my girlfriend.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.110
You're merciless.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:23.620
Mya-chan, do you have any plans?

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.990
I'm going to the bookstore.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:28.040
Oh. Then I'll go with you.

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.540
Dude, really?!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:34.090
Even without me, you'll have plenty
of people. What's the big deal?

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:37.050
We have manga we haven't discussed yet.

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:39.260
Manga? Are you a <i>fudanshi</i>?

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:40.430
No, I'm not.

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:45.390
He might be treating you as BL
material like my girlfriend, you know.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:46.220
Are you?

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:50.440
Huh? Come to think of it,
I've never done that with you.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:53.360
That's news to me.
Give him the same treatment.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.360
"Exception"

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.150
See ya.

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:57.690
Bye.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.740
I hope they have new stuff.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:00.820
Me, too.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:05.620
How do I describe it?

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:11.540
I don't get a solid <i>uke </i>or <i>seme</i>
vibe from Sasaki-senpai.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.250
Why is that?

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.920
We appreciate your business.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.550
All finished.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:24.840
A new volume is out! Wanna get it?

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.850
--Is something wrong?
--You're right. Let me get it real quick.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:33.270
Um, I was just thinking
how this is kinda nice.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:35.860
Ready to go? Find anything new?

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:40.280
I did! The next volume, and
something else from an author I like.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.870
The exit will be on the left.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:59.420
My stop is next. Mya-chan?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.030
Oh, you woke up.

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.900
I'm getting off here.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.450
Don't miss your stop.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.320
I won't.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.490
See you next term.

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:51.770
If Senpai only saw me as a <i>kouhai</i>,

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.730
would he, in that quiet tone,

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:56.900
here on the train,

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.610
(when I wasn't even awake!)

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:00.980
say that?

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:04.780
I like you.

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.410
What do I do?

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:47.510
"Episode 4: 'Limit'"
